ich_text","block_id":"Ryw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41f45b11-cc72-4f9f-a8c7-659c08e29783","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"前はproc読んだりDLL叩いたり（だっけ）しないといけなかったので便利そう","ts":"1620826612.122700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SUYsA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"506bf268-0d73-437e-88de-8ab288c4ca85","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういや、ヘルプにこれが追加されてた\n```\t\t\t*'autoshelldir'* *'asd'* *'noautoshelldir'* *'noasd'*\n'autoshelldir' 'asd'\t切替\t(既定ではオフ)\n\t\t\tグローバル\n\tオンの時、Vim は端末ウィンドウで動いているシェルのディレクトリが変更さ\n\tれる度に、現在のワーキングディレクトリを変更する。適切な設定がされる必\n\t要があり、シェルが pwd を変更する度に OSC 7 エスケープシーケンスを出力\n\tしないといけない。例として、Linuxなら、あなたのシェルが bash か zsh で\n\tprofile で /etc/profile.d/vte.sh を読み込む場合である。```\n前、terminalとの連動の話がここで出てた気がするけど、なんとかなるようになったようだ。","ts":"1620824808.122000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hPu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40e28900-6a5b-4dac-8b14-17906f134de1","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"gitbashの中でnvim起動するとset shell=bashにされるんですね\n当たり前っちゃ当たり前だけどこれで躓いた","ts":"1620824165.121400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a8a"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U021P814T51","text":"\u003c@U021P814T51\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620820359.121300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"ユーザーレビューで笑った","ts":"1620814834.119800","files":[{"id":"F021NVCNBJP","created":1620814806,"timestamp":1620814806,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U8CC7MDCL","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":116334,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/file